# Privacy Policy

**Last Updated: September 24, 2026**

This Privacy Policy explains how **[MU Private]** ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects information when you use our Discord App, website, and related game services.

## 1. Information We Collect

When you use our Discord App or connect your Discord account, we may collect:

- Discord User ID
- Discord username, display name, and avatar
- Discord server/guild information required for the App to operate
- Game account information necessary to provide game-related features
- Game character name, character ID, level, reset, ranking, or other publicly displayed game information
- Information you voluntarily provide when contacting our support team
- Technical information such as IP address, browser/device information, logs, and error information when you access our website or services

We only request the Discord permissions and information necessary for the App's functionality.

## 2. How We Use Information

We may use collected information to:

- Provide and operate the Discord App
- Link Discord accounts with MU Online accounts when requested
- Display game-related information, rankings, characters, or statistics
- Provide notifications and game-related features
- Authenticate users and prevent unauthorized access
- Detect abuse, fraud, cheating, or misuse of our services
- Troubleshoot technical problems and improve the App
- Respond to support requests
- Comply with applicable laws and legal requirements

We do not sell personal information to third parties.

## 3. Discord Information

Our App uses Discord's platform and APIs.

When you authorize the App, Discord may provide information according to the permissions you approve. We only use such information for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy and for providing the requested functionality.

Your use of Discord is also subject to Discord's own policies and terms.

## 4. Game Information

Information related to your MU Online account or characters may be processed to provide game services, including:

- Character information
- Character statistics
- Rankings and leaderboards
- Game achievements
- Event participation
- Game-related rewards and notifications

Some game information may be publicly displayed to other players when the relevant game feature allows it.

## 5. Data Storage and Security

We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction.

However, no Internet-based service can guarantee absolute security.

We retain information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.

## 6. Third-Party Services

Our services may use third-party services such as:

- Discord
- Hosting and server infrastructure providers
- Payment providers, where applicable
- Analytics, security, or monitoring services

These third parties may process information according to their own privacy policies and applicable laws.

## 7. Data Sharing

We do not sell or rent your personal information.

We may share limited information with service providers when necessary to operate our services, or when required by law, legal process, or to protect the rights, security, and property of our users and services.

## 8. Your Rights

Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights to:

- Request access to personal information we hold about you
- Request correction of inaccurate information
- Request deletion of certain information
- Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent
- Request information about how your data is processed

To make a request, contact us using the information below.

## 9. Data Deletion

You may request deletion of information associated with your Discord account or game account by contacting us.

Some information may need to be retained where required by law, necessary for security, fraud prevention, dispute resolution, or legitimate operational purposes.

## 10. Children's Privacy

Our services are not intended for users who are below the minimum age required to use Discord or our services under applicable law.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable laws.

## 11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time.

When we make changes, we will update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of our services after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised Privacy Policy where permitted by applicable law.

